{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"多名北都馬拉松參賽者身體不適送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-01-10-16-35f9yPalwD.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】有北都馬拉松的參賽者身體不適送院。</p><p>身體不適的參賽者被送到北區醫院治理，有跑手需要由擔架床送入醫院。亦有跑手在救護員協助坐在輪椅上，再送入院內治理。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:03.134908+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T02:03:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:09.010766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:50.554509+00:00","content_hash":"18e7aa457e8b329b6c48021c628efba98f5e1265d9586117b5e4f2029dbb8590","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}